// סורק: אילו נוסחאות-שדה בכל האפיונים מפנות לשדה-מחושב-אחות (או משתמשות ב-abs)
import fs from 'node:fs'; import path from 'node:path';
const dirs = ['machtzev/generator/specs-ds', 'machtzev/generator/specs'];
for (const d of dirs) { if (!fs.existsSync(d)) continue; for (const f of fs.readdirSync(d)) {
  const txt = fs.readFileSync(path.join(d, f), 'utf8');
  for (const line of txt.split('\n')) {
    if (!/ישות /.test(line)) continue;
    const parts = []; let depth = 0, cur = '';
    for (const ch of line) { if ('({[<'.includes(ch)) depth++; else if (')}]>'.includes(ch)) depth = Math.max(0, depth - 1); if (ch === ',' && depth === 0) { parts.push(cur); cur = ''; } else cur += ch; } parts.push(cur);
    const fields = parts.map((p) => p.trim()).map((p) => { const i = p.indexOf('='); return i > 0 ? { label: p.slice(0, i).replace(/[*!]|\[.*?\]|\{.*?\}/g, '').replace(/^.*(עם|:)\s+/, '').trim(), formula: p.slice(i + 1).trim() } : null; }).filter(Boolean);
    for (const a of fields) for (const b of fields) if (a !== b && a.formula.includes(b.label)) console.log(`${d}/${f}: «${a.label} = ${a.formula}» ⇒ מפנה ל-«${b.label}»`);
    for (const a of fields) if (/\babs\s*\(/.test(a.formula)) console.log(`${d}/${f}: abs: «${a.label} = ${a.formula}»`);
  }
} }
EOF
